# Copy this file to .env in the project root and fill in real values, then run:
#   docker compose up --build
#
# This one file feeds BOTH containers:
#  - frontend build arg (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL) — baked into the JS bundle at build time
#  - backend runtime env (everything else) — read at container start
#
# Note: only the BACKEND talks to Supabase. The frontend never sees a Supabase
# URL or key — it only ever calls this Express API.


# --- Supabase project settings (Project Settings -> API) ---
